MC Calendar is your go-to personal planner to organize day, week, month and a whole year. This all-in-one digital manager offers multiple customizable features to take your productivity to a whole new level. 

•	Set, edit and manage calendar events; 
•	Build graphical visualization of your daily/weekly/monthly/annual schedules;
•	And so much more!

With MC Calendar managing your busy day is no longer a challenge - it’s an easy and productive activity: 
-	Set your goals
-	Build customizable schedule of events.

MC Calendar is easy to use online and offline. There is also an option to synchronize your events and meetings from iCloud, Google, Outlook, Office365, etc. 

Whether you need to set up an agenda, to create a checklist or to reach balance between your work and life - we’ve got your covered! Check some of the incredible features of MC Calendar: 

Calendar
Create, manage and duplicate events;
Set recurrences and reminders; 
Invite attendees; 
Reschedule event’s duration with an easy drag-and-drop.

Design and customization 
Standard calendar views (daily, weekly, monthly and yearly basis);
Weekly view in two layouts: standard day-columns format and journal;
Combined agenda and monthly views for more convenience;
Automatic day or week swiping of the past or upcoming events;
Graphical visualization;
Interactive widget (5 types);
Day and night modes for the user interface;
Highlighted working hours in daily and weekly views;
Other tweaks to match personal preferences. 

Enjoy some of these fantastic features for free or activate the Pro Version for more advanced options. The Pro Version is available as a monthly/annual subscription or a one-time payment.

Some of the advanced features are:
•	Attaching files to events;
•	Printing;
•	Creating voice events;
•	Creating up to five private calendars;
•	Accessing full data backup and recovery;
•	Application blocking;
•	Configurable number of days viewed (per week);
•	Visualization of the weekly schedule in different formats;
•	Graphic visualization of how busy you are;
•	Forwarding events;
•	Changing accounts while editing;
•	Invitations to events.

All that variety is stored within, convenient interface of clear and simple design.

If you’re in search of a technically flawless daily planner, look no further! MC Calendar covers everything related to organizing and planning with convenience and accuracy.

Download MC Calendar and stay on top of your workflow and lifestyle!

